@startuml 06-harness-run-state
title Jev harness — run state machine (internal/harnessrun)

[*] --> queued : harness_start
queued --> running
running --> needs_attention : clarification\nor approval needed
needs_attention --> running : continue /\napproval granted (local UI/CLI only)
running --> cancelling : cancel
needs_attention --> cancelling : cancel
cancelling --> cancelled
running --> completed
running --> partial : budget exhausted
running --> failed
completed --> [*]
partial --> [*]
failed --> [*]
cancelled --> [*]

note right of needs_attention
  Approval bound to run, generation,
  action digest, expiry, file revisions.
  MCP continue cannot approve.
end note
@enduml
